        "en": "Lights every LED of a NeoPixel (WS2812) strip or ring in the same colour. Strip DIN (or DI) wire to the pin, 5V to 5V, GND to GND. Give the number of LEDs of the strip (up to 100); it must be the same in every block of this strip."
      },
